  "headline": "Oxacillin sodium is not on FDA's shortage list; our supply traces to a plant classified OAI 412 days before today",
  "headline_cites": ["D2", "E9", "D1"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include oxacillin sodium as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 389 vials of the 1 g injection, which at 15.2 vials per day provides 25.6 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The label for NDC 55150012715 names Aurobindo Pharma Limited (FEI 3004446312) as a registered manufacturing plant.",
      "cites": ["E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1286862 at that plant ended 2025-09-05 and was classified OAI, with the classification known on 2025-12-04.",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That OAI classification occurred 412 days before today.",
      "cites": ["E9", "D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked purchasing option is to buy from Armas Pharmaceuticals Inc., which uses ONESOURCE SPECIALTY PHARMA LIMITED - Beta Lactam Division, last inspected VAI on 2019-02-14.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A second option is Onesource Specialty Pharma Limited (same plant, VAI 2019-02-14), and a third is Baxter Healthcare Corporation, whose label names no identifiable plant.",
      "cites": ["D4", "D5"]
    }
  ]
}
